            "snippets": [
              "# Infighting among Trump's top advisers led to a negotiating disaster on the China trade deal\nBy Bob Bryan\n\ntrump mnuchin ross lighthizer navarro\n\nPresident Donald Trump with (2nd L-R) Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin, Commerce Secretary Wilbur Ross, U.S. Trade Representative Robert Lighthizer and White House National Trade Council Director Peter Navarro Chip Somodevilla/Getty Images\n\n2018-05-22T16:45:57Z\n\nFacebook Email X LinkedIn Copy link An icon in the shape of a lightning bolt.",
